{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"],"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"TracingDestinations","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}],"role":"collection","title":"TracingDestinations","symbolKind":"module"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" finds each record’s span from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the event was tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event’s description under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggerDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"references":{"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SpanEventDestination","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked.","type":"text"}]},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","title":"Choosing Destinations"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"TracingDestinations"}}}